      "content": "Classification Levels\n\nNorthstar uses four data classification levels: Public, Internal, Confidential, and Restricted.\n\nPublic data is approved for external sharing. Internal data is intended for Northstar employees. Confidential data includes customer business information, financial forecasts, non-public sales materials, and employee operational data. Restricted data includes secrets, credentials, regulated customer data, privileged security records, and sensitive HR case material.",
